# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../clips.rst:970
msgid ""
"**Usage Example:** Simulating a spinning effect by animating the rotation "
"curve."
msgstr ""
"**Exemple d'utilisation :** Simuler un effet de rotation en animant la "
